(7646797, 1243075, 67145, '<td valign="top">Sandy .. i saw this in voting and recognized your gorgeous granddaughter .. <br/>its the most beautiful photo and really captures her spirit .. something you do so well with your portraits of ppl .. <br/>i wasnt voting as i had something in the challenge .. shoot me . !!! .. <br/>i know a lot of ppl would think i''m doing the wrong thing ... <br/>but when you see the breakdown of votes .. a lot of the time the votes from those who were in the challenge and those who werent are quite different .. ie. lower votes from ppl who were in the challenge .. thats a very telling thing ..  .. <br/>anyway .. this is just gorgeous .. and please dont take anything away from this challenge but that you entered someone you absolutely adore and many many ppl absolutely loved it too .. xxx</td>', 'Sandy .. i saw this in voting and recognized your gorgeous granddaughter .. its the most beautiful photo and really captures her spirit .. something you do so well with your portraits of ppl .. i wasnt voting as i had something in the challenge .. shoot me . !!! .. i know a lot of ppl would think i''m doing the wrong thing ... but when you see the breakdown of votes .. a lot of the time the votes from those who were in the challenge and those who werent are quite different .. ie. lower votes from ppl who were in the challenge .. thats a very telling thing ..  .. anyway .. this is just gorgeous .. and please dont take anything away from this challenge but that you entered someone you absolutely adore and many many ppl absolutely loved it too .. xxx', '2019-11-20 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
