(7646807, 1243075, 30049, '<td valign="top">I was surprised to see this didn''t break the Top 10.  Your entry was one of my top picks (gave it an 8).  I found this to be truly a "Portrait" quality image that is full of energy and certainly worthy of framing in your home (which I hope someone does!).  Well done.</td>', 'I was surprised to see this didn''t break the Top 10.  Your entry was one of my top picks (gave it an 8).  I found this to be truly a "Portrait" quality image that is full of energy and certainly worthy of framing in your home (which I hope someone does!).  Well done.', '2019-11-20 07:39:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7646810, 1242990, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You are right!  He has a striking face!</td>', 'Wow!  You are right!  He has a striking face!', '2019-11-20 09:16:04.000000', NULL, 0),
