(7646821, 1242919, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow, Roz!!  I think this is amazing!  I do feel the love of this beautiful little creature!  I can almost hear her purring!  I agree with you 100% about not voting in challenges you have an entry in.  I never vote in challenges Im in either.  Personally, I think no one should be allowed to vote in challenges they have a vested interest in, and I think we should only be allowed to vote ONCE!  I have so often seen my score plummet at the end, with no new votes being added.  What in the heck could that be about except something competitive.   Oh well!  Its just a game we do for fun.   :).     You do amazing work, and here only 101 people even looked it.  Hardly enough for a verdict on its quality!<br/></td>', 'Wow, Roz!!  I think this is amazing!  I do feel the love of this beautiful little creature!  I can almost hear her purring!  I agree with you 100% about not voting in challenges you have an entry in.  I never vote in challenges Im in either.  Personally, I think no one should be allowed to vote in challenges they have a vested interest in, and I think we should only be allowed to vote ONCE!  I have so often seen my score plummet at the end, with no new votes being added.  What in the heck could that be about except something competitive.   Oh well!  Its just a game we do for fun.   :).     You do amazing work, and here only 101 people even looked it.  Hardly enough for a verdict on its quality!', '2019-11-20 09:34:01.000000', NULL, 0),
